        <p>FINANCES.</p>
        <p>The minutes Vie Finance Committe were passe lon the mntion of Mr. E. Imison, seconded by Mr. P. Sprak- man. Tie Fin toe Committe .1 recommended the accept- ance of the offer of the Llandudno Urban District Coun- cil to lend the Sum of £323 for five years, at 3 per cent. intereat per annum, and the tender of Messrs. Wood- land and Moore for tun supply of stationery for the next t welve months.</p>
        <p>This concluded the business.</p>
