        <head>GALE.</head>
        <p>THE GALE.</p>
        <p>DAMAGE IN THE LAKE DISTRICT.</p>
        <p>The floods in ths Lake district are in;reasing. At Cockermouth an improvised dam was swept away, and the water has surrounded and ente.ed the whole of the houses in the Goat distric, a thickly populated area. During Wednesday night oae of them collapsed. The iarnatee alarmed by bearing loud cracks, fortunately got Out in time, having to wade k aee'deep. In the country districts tarmsts have lost their stock, and at Lawton a bridge has been carried away.</p>
