        <p>BePt 3—St. Helene, h 4 4—Wigan, a lO 2 17—Morecambe, a 24 Warrington, h Dot. I—Tyldesley, a B—Runcorn, h 15—Lancashire v Cheshire, 22—Le1gh h lO 5 29—Rochdale 11., a 9 6 sov. s—Lancashire v Yorkshire, 12—Swinton, a</p>
