      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1898-11-04_WidnesExaminer_art0122" n="art0122">
        <head>THOUSANDS OF POUNDS WOP.TH BEING</head>
        <p>THOUSANDS OF POUNDS WOP.TH BEING</p>
        <p>CLEARED OUT,</p>
        <p>TOTALLY IRRBSPECTIVIC OF PROFIT.</p>
        <p>PITTS'S GREAT ANNIVERSARY SALE, now on. is Creating quite a sensation thrbughout the Furnishing Trade, as never before have such INESTIMABLE ADVAN- TAGES been offered ; and not only are the general public In hundreds from far and near patronising Pitts's. but also the elite of the district to such an extent as to cause grave dis- satisfaction amongst less favoured competitors. But who can wonder at the MARVELLOUS SUCCESS of the Sale considering that Pitta's have marked down their immense stock, entirely obliterating profit, thus enabling purchasers in many cases to SAVE from 25 to 50 per cent. Comparison will demonstrate the INCONTROVERTIBLE FACT that Pitts's are now offering New Suites, for instance, at sixteen or seventeen guineas each, exactly similar to those displayed as bargains in city show windows at 25 to 30 guineas each. same design, wood, workmanship, finish, mountings, Ste.. in fact, everything identically the same except that Pitts's price is little more than half, and a still GREATER SAVING Is shown in the Second-hand Department, where Pitts's price is only about a third of original cost. The veracity of these statements, on which Pitts's stake their half century reputation as the LARGEST, BEST, AND CHEAPEST GENERAL FURNISHERS,</p>
