        <p>Ths annusl central me,ti-ez of no memh-ra of this Soctiray wai held in the Distract Sctraolr Join on 'Mind iy evening. The report of the Dire:tors cra the year's sar,rkinz %Wa9 al follows :—" Your Dhe:tors hay: pleasure i preselt- ing the thirty-fifth annuat repot.: and statement of accounts, Eh -owing a satisfactory ri su!t of the year's op, rations, cett'fied by the auditors. It4e profi:s fmt the year amounts to £1,522 14 01. wWc'•, with the und yided balanc) from laat year of £2 542 184 1 shows adisps. able amount of £4,081 1941 ii ; from which te di!ectors recomm:nd the payment of a diyiden.l at the rate of 41 pf-r cent. per annum, alasrrning £1.430 2.91. and leav- ing a balar.c4 of undividel prof'', of £2.631 161 41, which is increased over last year by £9l 18s 31. Six members have ri!cif oiled the r property. reoresenting payments of capittl amounting to £4.118 154 71. One Tot of prop-rty on hand. Tie number of members on the bali is 384, holding 3184 shares."</p>
        <p>MOTHERS DO YOU REILIZE how y-ur litte on, suffer wh-ti th-ir tender pkins are literally on tire wi h itbing and burning PCVNIIAS and other irchirta. Ectiy and blotchy skin and scalp humours ? To know that a warm b,t'a with Curictute SOAP and a singlo ano!ntriz of Curicune, pure,t of emollient skin cure;, wiP, in the great majority of cases, afford instant reliet, permit r-s: and sleep, and /yin: to a prmAnnit and economical (b'- cauie so speedy) cure, and moment's delay, it. to f in your duty.. Nicreate:. l'XacY can hes"wen UP ,nnoatchtioldusthe :oh :ski: iwCi7ot b!emi.iti and a b)ds, touristel with pure blood.</p>
